Significant changes from the upstream release (mod version 4.3.1, Minecraft 1.21.1):

- Ported the build to Minecraft 1.21.11 with Fabric Loader 0.18.4 and
  Fabric API 0.141.6+1.21.11.
- Updated world generation data to the 1.21.11 schema:
  - worldgen/noise_settings/overworld.json: replaced the removed
    initial_density_without_jaggedness router entry with preliminary_surface_level
    (find_top_surface wrapper with this mod's world bounds).
  - dimension_type/overworld.json and overworld_caves.json: moved removed fields
    (bed_works, effects, has_raids, natural, piglin_safe, respawn_anchor_works,
    ultrawarm) into the new attributes map and added timelines.
  - pack.mcmeta: pack_format replaced with min_format/max_format 94.
- SteepSlopePredicateMixin: compute() is now public, to match the 1.21.11
  SteepMaterialCondition visibility.
- Fabric entrypoint uses net.minecraft.resources.Identifier instead of the
  removed net.minecraft.resources.ResourceLocation.
- Build tooling: Gradle 8.14.3, Fabric Loom 1.13, ModDevGradle 2.0.123.
